# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Database Drivers & Embedded DBs (MySQL Connector / HSQLDB)
# Justification: Database connections target managed AWS RDS instances inside
# private subnets over TLS; HSQLDB is isolated to test scopes.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CVE-2022-41853
CVE-2023-22102

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Micrometer & Spring Cloud Sleuth
# Justification: Telemetry metrics and tracing run on private internal cluster
# networks; no untrusted public HTTP transactions execute Sleuth TX instrumentation.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CVE-2026-40984
CVE-2026-41708

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Spring Cloud Gateway & WebFlux (api-gateway)
# Justification: Gateway routes are statically declared in configuration without
# dynamic SpEL expression parsing; functional predicate bypass does not affect
# static YAML path routing.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CVE-2025-41235
CVE-2025-41253
CVE-2026-47892

